# vvaharness/backends/harness/deepagents/translate.py

Turns DeepAgents / LangGraph terminal state and stream updates into the harness's backend-neutral result and message types. Decides what the session "answered": a valid structured response wins; otherwise the last non-empty assistant text, with truncation and refusal flags.

